  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is a real number <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>}</mo></math>. Then which of the following is <strong>NOT</strong> correct?</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />&nbsp;",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
